  "description": "Reid Transit | Commuter city bike\n\nLightweight, practical and built for everyday journeys – the ideal entry-level commuter bike for travelling to work or school, getting around town and carrying your everyday essentials.\n\nThe Reid Transit is designed to make everyday cycling affordable, comfortable and convenient. With its lightweight construction, versatile gearing and practical features, it's an ideal choice for first-time commuters looking for a reliable way to get to work, school or around town.\n\nIts lightweight alloy frame makes the bike easy to handle on busy streets, while integrated rack and mudguard mounts allow you to customise your setup to suit your daily routine. Add a rear rack and panniers to carry your work essentials, shopping or other belongings, or fit mudguards for extra protection when riding in wet weather.\n\nA 21-speed drivetrain provides a wide range of gearing options for tackling flat roads, hills and longer commutes, helping you ride comfortably across a variety of urban routes. Whether you're navigating city streets or taking on a more challenging journey, the Transit is built to make everyday cycling practical and accessible.\n\nWith its stylish design, versatile setup and excellent value, the Reid Transit is a great starting point for anyone looking to make cycling part of their daily routine. From the morning commute to trips around town, it's a practical alternative to driving that helps you carry what you need and enjoy the journey.\n\nThe Transit is ideal for:\n\nFirst-time commuters, looking for an affordable and reliable bike for travelling to work or school\n\nEveryday city riding, with a lightweight frame that's easy to handle around town\n\nRiders tackling hills and varied routes, with 21-speed gearing for a versatile range of riding conditions\n\nPractical everyday transport, with rack and mudguard mounts for adding luggage and weather protection\n\nCarrying work essentials and shopping, with the option to fit a rear rack and panniers to suit your needs\n\nRiders seeking a lightweight, durable bike, with an alloy frame designed for everyday use\n\nBudget-conscious cyclists, offering a practical and stylish entry into commuter cycling\n\nAnyone looking for an alternative to driving, making everyday journeys more active, convenient and enjoyable",
